              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 22,
                "start": 22
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "TransUnion argues that the 1,853 class members did not suffer a harm with a close relationship to defamation because the alerts were merely misleading, not literally false."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "TransUnion",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "999fb878304c48611e3eebbbabd9f9eca746849fd296c5a12a59e1f9609824b6",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-999fb878304c-0002-0004"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 25,
                "start": 25
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to TransUnion, risk of future harm alone does not qualify as concrete harm unless it causes a separate concrete injury."
        }
      ],
      "heading": "TransUnion",
      "status": "complete",
      "summary": null,
